WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.165
- I mean, you just told me
things in the past few hours,

00:00:03.165 --> 00:00:07.541
that you should've told
me many, many years ago.

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:09.328
I don't know, I think it's--

00:00:09.328 --> 00:00:10.161
- [Eugene's Dad] Are you crying?

00:00:10.161 --> 00:00:11.431
- No, are you crying?

00:00:11.431 --> 00:00:14.931
(slow, melancholic music)

00:00:26.114 --> 00:00:27.210
- One of the most pivotal things

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.973
that a father teaches his son,

00:00:28.973 --> 00:00:30.359
is how to shave.

00:00:30.359 --> 00:00:32.028
- A real right of passage.

00:00:32.028 --> 00:00:33.951
- The video you're most excited about.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.409
- Yeah.

00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:36.842
- I remember you teaching me how to shave,

00:00:36.842 --> 00:00:39.127
it was a big moment.

00:00:39.127 --> 00:00:41.265
- I remember my father
teaching me how to shave.

00:00:41.265 --> 00:00:42.547
- And it, in some cases,

00:00:42.547 --> 00:00:44.531
is one of the last really big things

00:00:44.531 --> 00:00:45.997
that your dad teaches you.

00:00:45.997 --> 00:00:47.033
- So as a Father's Day gift,

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:50.048
I'm going to shave you
like you did for me,

00:00:50.048 --> 00:00:50.881
back when I was a kid.

00:00:50.881 --> 00:00:52.239
- Well thank you, Eugene.

00:00:52.239 --> 00:00:53.166
- Are you afraid?

00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:53.999
- Yeah.

00:00:53.999 --> 00:00:54.987
- Do you feel comfortable?

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:55.820
- No.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.176
- I will say, if I mess up at all,

00:00:57.176 --> 00:01:00.017
it's because you taught me.

00:01:00.017 --> 00:01:01.497
You're in good hands.

00:01:01.497 --> 00:01:02.701
- Whenever you're at the haircut place,

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:03.793
do you feel trapped?

00:01:03.793 --> 00:01:05.684
- I feel trapped whenever I'm in a chair,

00:01:05.684 --> 00:01:08.257
