00:01:16.523 --> 00:01:17.356
- Might...

00:01:17.356 --> 00:01:18.564
(laughing)

00:01:18.564 --> 00:01:20.089
Like a pond in my lap.

00:01:20.089 --> 00:01:21.415
- Sorry, I don't

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:22.897
