00:01:27.832 --> 00:01:28.665
- Right.

00:01:28.665 --> 00:01:30.494
Especially someone who's
not qualified to do it.

00:01:30.494 --> 00:01:32.131
- That's exactly right, yeah.

00:01:32.131 --> 00:01:33.232
This is not how you shave.

00:01:33.232 --> 00:01:34.478
- Kind of open up, ah!

00:01:34.478 --> 00:01:36.609
(laughing)

00:01:36.609 --> 00:01:37.650
- Not really.
- It's a little weird.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:39.062
- That's not chloroform, right?

00:01:39.062 --> 00:01:39.895
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:39.895 --> 00:01:42.847
- That'd probably be better for a cleanse.

00:01:42.847 --> 00:01:44.099
- Oh! (laughing)

00:01:44.099 --> 00:01:46.114
