my shirt is right now.

00:01:48.393 --> 00:01:49.626
- What do you use? Gillette.

00:01:49.626 --> 00:01:50.959
- Right.
- Yeah.

00:01:51.819 --> 00:01:52.819
- Tom Brady.

00:01:53.998 --> 00:01:54.831
- Sure.

00:01:57.875 --> 00:01:59.805
- I feel like I'm pawing
him like a kitten.

00:01:59.805 --> 00:02:00.973
