00:02:05.218 --> 00:02:06.958
(laughing)

00:02:06.958 --> 00:02:08.358
You're giving massage after this?

00:02:08.358 --> 00:02:09.191
- [Eugene] No.

00:02:09.191 --> 00:02:11.940
- So the first thing, the
thing that you taught me,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.031
when I was learning how to shave,

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:15.781
