00:02:21.658 --> 00:02:24.089
- Do you wanna stretch
your skin in any way?

00:02:24.089 --> 00:02:25.009
Do you have to do that?

00:02:25.009 --> 00:02:25.967
- I don't know.

00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:26.800
- Okay.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:27.633
- I'm trying to--
