00:02:34.481 --> 00:02:35.439
- Really?
- Mm-hmm.

00:02:35.439 --> 00:02:36.484
- Okay, one, two, three.

00:02:36.484 --> 00:02:37.653
- Huh.

00:02:37.653 --> 00:02:38.506
- See that?

00:02:38.506 --> 00:02:39.928
That was in my dad's nose.

00:02:39.928 --> 00:02:40.989
- [Dad] Ew.

00:02:40.989 --> 00:02:42.028
- Can't get more intimate than that, Dad.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:42.861
- Wow.

00:02:42.861 --> 00:02:45.617
- While I have you
captive, in a barber chair,

00:02:45.617 --> 00:02:48.534
why don't I ask you some questions.

00:02:49.713 --> 00:02:51.301
- Like, there's a lot
I know about your life,

00:02:51.301 --> 00:02:52.842
