00:06:54.465 --> 00:06:56.436
- How old were you?

00:06:56.436 --> 00:06:58.403
- It was high school.

00:06:58.403 --> 00:07:00.191
- How'd you take care of
yourself in high school?

00:07:00.191 --> 00:07:04.108
- Well, I had a good
family, good relative, so.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:07.803
They help.

00:07:08.983 --> 00:07:09.816
Are you crying?

00:07:09.816 --> 00:07:11.013
- No, are you crying?

00:07:11.013 --> 00:07:13.251
Well, I'm just confused why,

00:07:13.251 --> 00:07:14.477
I mean, I only had on grandma,

00:07:14.477 --> 00:07:16.061
it's just Mom's mom.

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:18.411
But what, she was alive when we were kids?

00:07:18.411 --> 00:07:19.244
- Right.
- And you never tried

00:07:19.244 --> 00:07:20.965
to reach out to her?

00:07:20.965 --> 00:07:24.025
- [Eugene's Dad] Well, yeah, I didn't try.

00:07:24.025 --> 00:07:24.982
- Is it 'cause she left you?

00:07:24.982 --> 00:07:26.876
- [Eugene's Dad] Mm-hmm.

00:07:26.876 --> 00:07:28.826
- What do you mean, she just left?

00:07:28.826 --> 00:07:29.854
The family?

00:07:29.854 --> 00:07:31.139
- [Eugene's Dad] Right.

00:07:31.139 --> 00:07:32.213
- Well how'd you take care of yourself?

00:07:32.213 --> 00:07:35.567
- My high school teacher
called me one day.

00:07:35.567 --> 00:07:38.484
He said, "Uh-jay, you any trouble?"

00:07:39.349 --> 00:07:40.775
I said, "Why?"

00:07:40.775 --> 00:07:41.962
Goes, "You gonna flunk."

00:07:41.962 --> 00:07:44.064
