00:09:48.886 --> 00:09:50.049
will be so challenging,

00:09:50.049 --> 00:09:54.049
that it'll stress our
relationship in a way that

00:09:56.436 --> 00:09:58.671
I don't know if we're ready for.

00:09:58.671 --> 00:10:00.712
- I mean, you're not gonna be ready.

00:10:00.712 --> 00:10:01.545
- Yeah.

00:10:01.545 --> 00:10:04.162
- You don't, you're gonna
just have to work it out.

00:10:04.162 --> 00:10:07.920
Every parent's gonna be
different, you're gonna do fine.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.378
- What do you think of Becky?

00:10:09.378 --> 00:10:11.128
- Oh, I love her.

00:10:11.128 --> 00:10:11.961
- Oh, that's good.

00:10:11.961 --> 00:10:14.169
- We're so happy that

00:10:14.169 --> 00:10:17.119
she's sweet and intelligent

00:10:17.119 --> 00:10:17.952
and

00:10:20.443 --> 00:10:22.193
she kinda understands

00:10:25.344 --> 00:10:27.139
maybe whatever peculiar habits

00:10:27.139 --> 00:10:29.023
with your ladies you may have.

00:10:29.023 --> 00:10:30.875
- And that, I am excited to have a kid.

00:10:30.875 --> 00:10:33.125
And I think the entire way,

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.393
I'll just be thinking of the example

00:10:36.393 --> 00:10:38.391
that you and Mom set for me.

00:10:38.391 --> 00:10:39.244
- Good.

00:10:39.244 --> 00:10:41.285
- And I wanted to thank you.

00:10:41.285 --> 00:10:42.370
When I was growing up,

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.128
and when I was dealing with depression,

00:10:45.128 --> 00:10:47.875
you and Mom always supported me,

00:10:47.875 --> 00:10:49.367
you supported me creatively.

00:10:49.367 --> 00:10:52.108
